<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Hot Topic.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Hot Topic.</headline>
<dateline>SAN FRANCISCO 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Robertson, Stephens &amp; Co analyst Lauren Levitan raised revenue estimates on Hot Topic Inc based on strong fiscal second quarter results.</p>
<p>-- raised her 1997 revenue estimate 1.3 percent to $69.0 million from $68.1 million.</p>
<p>-- said in a statement the company is on track to meet her fiscal third quarter earnings estimate of $0.21 a share, up from $0.16 a year earlier.</p>
<p>-- company sells young men's and women's apparel.</p>
<p>-- company reported earnings of $0.04 a share on $13.7 million in revenues for fiscal second quarter ended August 2, versus $0.02 a share and $8.9 million in revenues a year earlier.</p>
</text>
